ely eyes stands before the tower, her hair subtly changing color with the starlight. She wears comfortable and practical attire adorned with trinkets from other worlds. Her smile is as warm as the rising sun, drawing the attention of nearby residents. The city's architecture blends nature and technology, with vines and flowers adorning every building. The air is filled with a faint floral scent and the earthy aroma, with ancient whispers carried by the wind. The composition uses asymmetrical design, with the woman positioned on one side of the frame and the Star Tower leaning towards the opposite side, creating a dynamic balance that enhances the harmony of tranquility and beauty."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["需要调整的主要有模型和内容修改区两个部分。\n\n新人只需要调整内容修改区的参数即可。 \n\n修改区最左边的文本框中支持输入中文，此处是输入文生图提示词的区域\n\n\n最右边的是参考图片输入区域，用于提取参考图片深度图"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [424.1335754394531, 759.4058227539062], "pos": [-2584.81640625, 336.7071533203125], "id": 86, "properties": {}, "order": 8}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [{"controller": 11, "upstream": "8", "downstream_slot": 1, "downstream": 60, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "VAE"}, {"controller": 11, "upstream": "8", "downstream_slot": 4, "downstream": 55, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "VAE"}, {"controller": 11, "upstream": "9", "downstream_slot": 0, "downstream": 17, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "MODEL"}, {"controller": 11, "upstream": "8", "downstream_slot": 1, "downstream": 21, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "VAE"}, {"controller": 11, "upstream": "8", "downstream_slot": 1, "downstream": 73, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "VAE"}, {"contro